Relevant Healthcare | Lead Engineer | Remote (US&#x2F;Canada only) | Full-time

Relevant builds a data platform that helps safety-net healthcare providers deliver better care using data from their electronic health records. Our customers are non-profit clinics called Community Health Centers. You can read more about them, us, and the role on our jobs page: https:&#x2F;&#x2F;relevant.healthcare&#x2F;jobs&#x2F; 

We're a small team (~25 overall). We're bootstrapped (no external capital whatsoever, VC or otherwise) and profitable. We've got a modern tech stack (Rails, Typescript, Go, React, GraphQL, d3) and a healthy approach to both tech debt and work&#x2F;life balance… and we’re also a very nice group of people that get to work on interesting problems for some of the few unimpeachably good actors in healthcare!

Cleverbase | https:&#x2F;&#x2F;cleverbase.com&#x2F; | The Hague, Netherlands | ONSITE (hybrid) | Full-time

Cleverbase runs an API platform for online trust: qualified e-signatures, PKI, digital identity and high-assurance identity onboarding for European organisations. We’re now building towards the EU Digital Identity Wallet and the European Business Wallet. Helping customers design and ship their solutions on our platform matters as much to us as building the platform itself.

As a Qualified Trust Service Provider under eIDAS, what we ship has to be demonstrably correct, auditable and secure, and we still deploy frequently. We go beyond compliance by applying modern cryptography to better protect personal data, because our mission is everyone secure online.

Stack: JVM (Scala with Cats&#x2F;Cats-Effect, http4s, fs2, doobie), gRPC, Postgres and HSMs for the trust services; TypeScript (React, NestJS, oRPC, Drizzle, Playwright) for web; standards like JSON&#x2F;XML&#x2F;PDF signatures and OpenID. Experience with this exact stack isn't required, but interest in cryptography or digital identity is.

Roles currently available:

Web Engineer (Medior): https:&#x2F;&#x2F;cleverbase.com&#x2F;en&#x2F;careers&#x2F;web-engineer-medior&#x2F; 

Web Engineer (Senior): https:&#x2F;&#x2F;cleverbase.com&#x2F;en&#x2F;careers&#x2F;web-engineer-senior&#x2F; 

Solution Engineer (Medior): https:&#x2F;&#x2F;cleverbase.com&#x2F;en&#x2F;careers&#x2F;solution-engineer-medior&#x2F; 

Apply: email me (CTO) sander.dijkhuis@cleverbase.com with your CV and a short note, and mention that you found us through this HN post.

